(cannot retain LUA code)

[https://github.com/ItsDeidara/The-Binding-of-Isaac-Mod-Conversion-Kit The-Binding-of-Isaac-Mod-Conversion-Kit] is a tool to convert mods the PC version of The Binding of Isaac to their console counterparts.

